00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:45,330
created by the pituitary gland to tell the thyroid to screen more thyroid hormones. So when the blood

00:00:45,330 --> 00:00:52,930
levels of T3 and T4 are low, stimulates the hypothalamus to tell the pituitary to tell the

00:00:52,930 --> 00:01:00,770
thyroid to screen more T4. I mean, most of the hormones created by the thyroid gland is T4.

